  "step_3": "The decision reason focuses on comparing the probabilities of the maximum outcomes and prefers the lottery with the lower such probability. The individual does consider the probabilities of the maximum outcomes (33% vs. 34%), so the relevant information is present in their deliberation. However, their justification for choosing Lottery A is based on the higher monetary value (100 Euros more) and the near-identical probabilities, not on a rule to prefer lower probabilities of the maximum outcome. There is no indication that they preferred A because 33% is lower than 34% for the maximum outcome; rather, they preferred A because it offers a better outcome with similar chances. Therefore, while the information is considered, the decision rule of the reason (prefer lower probability of maximum outcome) is not reflected in the justification. The reasoning process described does not align with the logic of the decision reason.",
